No d-spacing, orbit or cell content in this library is validated on a real
diffraction pattern: that validation is each app's to register against a tag.


================================================================================
mac4DSTEM and macTEM (the seeds of slice 1)
================================================================================

The cell, lattice and reflection-list code, the CIF parser with its
written-precision expansion and its refusals, the family (ring) rule and the
monoclinic orbit convention are ported from mac4DSTEM (commit 7448401b:
mac4DSTEM/Core/Crystal/Crystal.swift, CrystalModel.swift, CIFImport.swift) and
macTEM (commit a58c84c: Sources/TEMCore/Analysis/DSpacingIndexing.swift, ADR
022, and the V1-8 S2c registration), generalised to the seven crystal systems.
The CIF fixtures under Tests/DiffractoCoreTests/Fixtures come from mac4DSTEM's
tests at the same commit, each with its provenance in a comment line.

    mac4DSTEM - https://github.com/mac4DSTEM/mac4DSTEM
    macTEM    - https://github.com/mac4DSTEM/macTEM
